OL,3,GNEWSAFormer classmates reunite as
OL,4,Aprimary school turns 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a school that gave shelter in the
OL,7,Fdevastating Belfast Blitz during World
OL,8,FWar Two.
OL,10,FAnd Euston Street Primary School in
OL,11,Finner east Belfast is now celebrating
OL,12,Fits 100th birthday.
OL,14,FIt was officially opened in July 1926,
OL,15,Fjust in time to admit pupils for the
OL,16,Fnew school term.
OL,18,FAnd a century on, the school has opened
OL,19,Fits doors and classrooms to welcome
OL,20,Fback many former pupils to celebrate
OL,21,Fthe big birthday.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
